# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
# Ignore all Flutter build output. Vercel re-runs `build.sh` on every
# deploy, so the build/web directory is regenerated server-side and
# never needs to live in the repo. (Vercel-side caching keeps the
# Flutter clone + pub cache warm between builds.)
/build/
/coverage/

# Local Supabase runtime configuration. Keep real credentials on your machine.
supabase.json

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
